 result={'at_utc':now(),'module':'15','test':'CAPACITY_CONSTRAINED_THREE_PHASE_EXISTENCE_TEST','gate':gate,'theoretical_witness_exists':True,'theory_ref':f['witness'],'phases':phases,'GPU_sessions':9,'successful_three_phase_instance':passed,'latency_SLO_defined_or_claimed':False,'E2E_metrics_descriptive_only':True,'memory_rho_quality_admission_frozen':True,'full_pool_CPU_optimization_used':True,'original_V3_sources_unchanged':True,'original_V3_CPU_baseline_only':True,'GPU_QPS_or_routing_moved_after_outcome':False,'new_model_search':0,'new_replica_profiling':0,'stop':True,'rejections':reasons,'scope':'Three fixed development operating points with 120s cohorts and three fresh process repetitions each; no continuous stable-window guarantee, no held-out/global optimum claim, and no invented latency SLO.'};save('module15_gate.json',result)
 w=read(OUT/'theoretical_witness.json')['witness'];cpu=read(OUT/'cpu_independent_verification.json');protect=read(OUT/'protected_before.json');verify(protect['files']);verify(read(OUT/'search_protocol_freeze.json')['implementation']);save('completion_verification.json',{'at_utc':now(),'historical_files_unchanged':True,'protected_files_verified':len(protect['files']),'all_frozen_points_routes_and_sources_verified':True,'CPU_independent_LP_and_MILP_checks':cpu['checks'],'real_sessions':9,'valid_sessions':sum(r['valid_session'] for r in rows),'releases_verified':all(r['GPU_release_verified'] for r in rows),'all_worker_PIDs_independent':len({pid for r in rows for pid in r['observed_worker_PIDs'].values()})==sum(r['observed_worker_count'] for r in rows),'formal_three_phase_gate':gate,'no_extra_GPU_or_profiling':True})
 txt=f"# Module 15：Capacity-Constrained Three-Phase Existence Test\n\nGate：**{gate}**。用户确认项目没有预定义E2E latency SLO，因此本模块不设置/宣称满足任何人为mean/P95阈值。冻结原quality/capability admission、14F实测safe memory、rho≤0.8、已测s0/g(x)/M(x)。E2E mean/P95只报告实测。\n\n## 固定配置与CPU完整模型池竞争\n\nG=**microsoft/Phi-4-multimodal-instruct@93f923e1a7727d1c4f446756212d9d3e8fcc5d81**，S=**openai/whisper-small@973afd24965f72e36ca33b3055d56a652f456b4d**；目标ASR，必需背景VQA恒为0.2 QPS。固定B1={w['budget_mib']:.9f}MiB。M_G idle={w['M_G_raw_mib']:.6f}MiB / safe={w['M_G_safe_mib']:.6f}MiB；M_S idle={w['M_S_raw_mib']:.6f}MiB / safe={w['M_S_safe_mib']:.6f}MiB。G+S safe={w['candidate_memory_mib']:.6f}MiB，G+S2实测safe={w['G_plus_S2_safe_mib']:.6f}MiB>B1。\n\nC_G=(0.8×g_G1−0.2×s_G,VQA)/s_G,ASR={w['C_G_rps']:.12f}QPS；C_S=0.8×g_S1/s_S,ASR={w['C_S_rps']:.12f}QPS，满足0<C_G<C_S。质量未修改：Phi ASR WER=0.019519856405654026；Whisper-small ASR WER=0.042180839129459274，均通过原WER≤0.042181；VQA沿用原语义准入。\n\n资源优先目标是全池minimum measured safe memory；同最小cost的全部states再由原Module9 J-routing选择，不把replica count插在J之前，不强制G或S身份。完整已测E/H池参与，未测counts保持UNKNOWN，无linear extrapolation。独立枚举与LP确认：此预算中与正负载相关、覆盖ASR/VQA的已测驻留状态只有G1-only与G1+S1；LOW二者都可行但前者资源更小，MID/HIGH只剩后者容量可行。Qwen/Minicpm单G、Phi2、其它ASR S、Whisper-small2/3均因实测memory不满足同预算。详见measured_model_competition.csv；这不证明所有未测count物理不可能。\n\n|阶段|ASR QPS|最优驻留|CPU G份额|CPU S份额|max rho|safe MiB|\n|---|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n"
